<title>POLAND: Polish average wage rises to PLN 1154 in December.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage rises to PLN 1154 in December.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wage in the enterprise sector rose to 1154 zlotys in December, 1996, from 1071 zlotys in November, and was 24.6 percent higher than a year ago, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	 DECEMBER    NOVEMBER    DEC 1995</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN	1154	  1071	     926</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
